here we have the data compiling global observations intersected with the UNWCMC-WDPA shapefiles downloaded 30 May 2022 (version)

the main file is all.characteristics.mpas.Rdata please read metadata metadata_mpa.char_version0_1.txt for information about all variables contained in this file.
a csv version of the same file is all.characteristics.mpas.csv

additional data:
mpa_within_all_fisheries_effort.Rdata: list of 9 data frames (2012 to 2020) breaking down the estimate apparent fishing effort in the MPAs for each of the 17 gear types

mpa_threats_characteristics.Rdata: R object containing 9 data frames describing the count of species for each MPA which threatened by each IUCN Red List 
conservation threat/sub-threats/full threat description. This file also contains
death.interact which describes for each species threatened by fisheries the mode of the threat (bycatch, incidental catches, unintentional catches, and entaglement) and
fish.interact which describes for each species threatened by fisheries which gear type causes this threat.
